	(text "LTC6810 (6-cell) → LTC6811IG-2-TRPBF (12-cell)\n\nLearned: cells-per-chip reshapes the pack and add fully different architecture \n\n• Double the capacity: Monitors up to 12 series cells instead of 6, cutting the required number of ICs and components in half.\n• Higher precision: Drops maximum measurement error from 1.8 mV to 1.2 mV, which is critical for flat-voltage chemistries like LiFePO4.\n• Faster throughput: Samples twice as many cells within the identical 290 µs measurement window.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.31 32.258 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "77ac7261-0470-4ebe-a38b-adf44a928372")
	)
	(text "ISOSpi isolation and filtering"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 353.06 118.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
